window.products.push({"id":650022,"name":"Owl Candle – Unscented – Skeleton Candles – Purple","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51NVNZ3chjL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"Owls are nocturnal, actively hunting their prey only in darkness. The owl shaped candle reveals the creature like a skeleton inside, a grinning wise metallic skeleton with fire blazing in the eyes! Strike a match and watch this owl in the shadows of darkness. Purple Owl Candle Dimensions 6\" x 4\" x 3\" Burn time 10-15 Hours Each candle is unscented. Materials: Paraffin Wax, Cotton Wick, and Aluminum Use And Safety Remove all Packaging and place the candle on heat resistant surface. Burn candle no longer than 3-4 hours per lighting. Keep wick trimmed ¼ inch to prevent a smoking candle. Keep burning candles out of drafty areas, as drafts will cause the candle to burn unevenly. Discontinue use when a ½ inch of wax remains at the bottom. Never leave burning candle unattended. Keep away from children and pets.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51NVNZ3chjL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Skeleton Candles","source_asin":"B01JHI1GAS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-650022","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01JHI1GAS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01JHI1GAS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
