window.products.push({"id":650094,"name":"Kingnice Ice Cream Scoop, Stainless Steel with Trigger, Cookie, Melon Scoop Spoon (Mediu size, ball diameter: 5.3cm)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616ljdoC1rL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"How to Scoop Ice Cream？ 1. Choose a kingnice ice cream scoop with good handle grip, sharp edges (this makes for easy scooping) and wide scoop (for maximum ice cream retrieval) 2. Heat the scooper for 20-30 seconds. Heating the scoops makes it easier to glide through the ice cream and ultimately speeds up the process. 3. Scoop from the side. Using the side edge of your scoop, scoop in a circular motion or an \"S\" shaped motion, allowing for round, even scoops.  4. Serve. When you have scooped out the ice cream, place it in a dish or a cone and enjoy! Comes in sizes:￼￼ Large spoon length: 22.5cm; Spoon ball diameter: 5.3cm ￼￼ Package Detail:￼￼ (1pcs) Ice Cream Scoop Set About after-sales service: Our goal is to provide high quality service and products, if you have any questions or not 100% satisfied for any reason about our products, please kindly put forward to us, we will try our best to help you and answer for you. So don't hesitate, please purchase with confidence. 3 years warranty against manufacturer's defects. As buyer, do you know the 304 STAINLESS STEEL? Our products are all made of 304 stainless steel.  It has excellent resistance to a wide range of atmospheric environments and many corrosive media.  It is subject to pitting and crevice corrosion in warm chloride environments and to stress corrosion cracking above about 60 °C. It is considered resistant to potable water with up to about 200 mg/L chlorides at ambient temperatures, reducing to about 150 mg/L at 60 °C.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616ljdoC1rL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kingnice","source_asin":"B06XNQLZ12","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-650094","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06XNQLZ12","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06XNQLZ12","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
