window.products.push({"id":650117,"name":"Shinfuku Short Snap in Type Wall Clock Mechanism with 53# Black Hands Silent Plastic DIY Clock Accessory Kits Sweep Quartz Movement (5mm Hour axis Len","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5150MYIb-iL._AC_.jpg","description":"Brand:ShinfukuName: Quartz clock movements Size:Case 55*55mm,Total axis length 8mm,hour axis length 5mmMovement case material: Plastic Parts within movement material: Copper wire and Plastic Clock hand Material: Aluminum Dial Fixation: Centre Screw Second hand motion: Sweep Accuracy Within ±30seconds deviation each month (in normal temperature) Battery: one 1.5V Carbon-zinc batteries only,not included. Please DO NOT USE Alkaline battery,Rechargeable batteries,they will damage the movement. Movement Net Weight: 23g Place of Origin: GuangDong China (Mainland) Packing: Simple and Safe packing Parts: Nut and Clock hands Characteristic: Mute Used for: Prepair original clock,DIY clock This movement can be used when DIY Clock,it's a clock accessory. You can also use it to change your orriginal bad clock movement,this will save much money because you didn't need to repalce the whole clock Instruction for installation This under current equipment fit 1.5V Carbon-zinc battery Only,Please Do not use high current batteries,rechargeable batteries,they will damage the movement. As we know,batteries has many limits on air transportation,in order to make shipping more smoothly,batteries didn't included in our package When you install Clock hand, just press down the clock hand to the axis vertically,do not need to twist the hand. Check three hands,make sure they didn't meet each other,first place three hands all point 12 and then adjust wheel gear to current time,when adjust take note that three hands move fluently,if meet split it Shinfuku movement is one of the best quartz clock movements in the world,it move super mute keep better time and require less maintenance,when you use correct battery and install clock hand correctly,you will be very pleased with it's work","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/5150MYIb-iL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shinfuku Snap In Type","source_asin":"B01N2QYW6Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-650117","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N2QYW6Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N2QYW6Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
