window.products.push({"id":650136,"name":"KeepCup Living Coral Original, 12oz","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7124J9znd4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep cup encourages the use of reusable Cups. Our sustainably-made products are fit for purpose, challenge convenience culture, and make a positive difference to the environment. Enjoy a great tea or Coffee in our reusable Cups. Our keep cups come in premium tempered glass, lightweight BPS BPA free plastic, and in a variety of sizes. Lighten up your morning commute with a keep cup travel mug. Keep cup components are detachable and replaceable. Ordering replacement parts from keep cup – lids, bands – is much more energy efficient and less wasteful than buying a whole new keep cup. Barista standard. Keep cup is widely accepted and endorsed by the specialty Coffee industry. Barista standard means our products are fit for purpose behind the Coffee machine, and fit easily into a busy service environment. Each keep cup has internal fill lines so baristas can dose Coffee correctly. So even if you have a 12oz (medium) keep cup and order a small takeaway Coffee, your barista can fill to the 8oz line. Keep cup was created to help reuse become part of your daily life. Driving, Riding or pushing a Pram, keep cup is designed to fit into most cup holders. Keep cup: responsible business. Our retail boxes are made from forest Stewardship Council (FSC) certified cardboard. The insert brochures included with each keep cup are printed on FSC certified paper. Our outer cartons are made from 100% recycled cardboard. They’re manufactured locally at each of our three hubs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7124J9znd4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KeepCup","source_asin":"B07P276PC5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-650136","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07P276PC5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07P276PC5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":650137,"name":"Wotermly Digital Kitchen Meat Thermometer with Backlight LCD and Foldable Long Probe, Instant Read Food Cooking Thermometer Use for Grill,Liquid, BBQ,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":6.28,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61C8nf+H9sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Accurate and Fast: The Wotermly digital kitchen meat thermometer only takes 2s-3s to complete a temperature measurement. At a wide range of -58℉ to 572℉, the accurate achieve to +/- 2 degree. No need to wait for the hot oven or the grill temperature to stabilize. Whether it is fried steak, grill, pork, lamb, turkey, fried fish, potatoes, or outdoor BBQ, this meat thermometer can provide you with an accurate temperature reference. [Easy to Use] Press the on/off button, it starts to read the temperature. Insert the probe into the food, the large dial will display an accurate and easy-to-read temperature number in 2s. [Long Probe Design]：The Wotermly food cooking thermometer have a 4¼ inch long probe. It is longer than most of the foldable meat thermometers in the market. When you hold it near hot food, you can read food temperature data more gracefully and easily, without having to worry about the tension of your hands being too close to hot food. [Built your Cooking Confidence] Using our digital meat thermometer, you can cook any food with confidence to achieve perfection. Never worry about overcooked or undercooked to damage your steak. Be inspired by more cooking and grilling. Be creative in the kitchen. [Widely Used] : Cooking is the main use scenario. In addition, we can also use it to measure bath water temperature, milk temperature, baby food temperature, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61C8nf+H9sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wotermly","source_asin":"B09QZYFDSK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-650137","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QZYFDSK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QZYFDSK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":650138,"name":"Parastone Couple on a Duck Seduction Sin Statue by Hieronymos Bosch Garden Earthly Delights","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ch9y3vZoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"On the left of the central panel of the religious triptych painting Garden of Earthly Delights by Bosch (ca 1450 - 1516), an unsuspecting man is seduced by a black woman. In the Middle Ages, Negroes were viewed as evil. The sin takes place on a duck, the symbol of stupidity and alcoholism, and is observed by a large, colorful kingfisher. Bosch's religious painting today is beloved by fantasy and mystical believers who view Bosch as one of the forerunners to Surrealism.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ch9y3vZoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Parastone","source_asin":"B00C20M9DC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-650138","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00C20M9DC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00C20M9DC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
