window.products.push({"id":650163,"name":"Over Door Towel Racks Hooks Racks Holder Organizer Robe Coat Bag Hats Key Clothes Wall Mount Hang on The Door Cabinet Cupboard for Bathroom Bedroom Ki","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aXn7KcYiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Stylish and Generous Design, suitable for any location in the home, beautiful practical, adding more storage space you. Hang your towels, robes, umbrella, bag, washcloths, coats, sweaters, swimwear, sack, pajamas, bathrobes, hats, bags, purse, clothes, keys, loofah, belts, kitchen utensils, brushes, baseball caps, etc. Help you save tidy up room. Fashion Design- Newest \"TOWELS\" fonts design, made of high-quality high metal, with black sandblasting, laser cutting, durable, fadeless, carving carefully, wonderful and delicate, matte black finish long-lasting rustproof and waterproof. Easy Care - wipe clean with a damp cloth. Don’t let the thought of drilling holes in walls and doors stop you from getting your home organized. Using an over-the-door hook can help you make use of the wasted vertical space on your doors. Quite Easy To Put Together- The towel rack is detachable. You can fix the towel rack on the wall or hang it over the door, suit for bathroom, kitchen, cabinets, hallways, pool, beach, living room and bedrooms, etc. Add extra hanging storage to any room. Five double hooks to conveniently store your towels and clothing behind your door, enjoy a well-planned and organized lifestyle What's in the package- 1 x Overdoor Towels hook hanger, 6 x sponge pads, 3 x screws, 3 x screw anchors. Dimensions: 17\"L x 12\"H. Please refer to the detailed dimensions of the picture, the strong and durable metal door towel hooks fit standard doors up to 1-3/4\" (4.5cm) thick. For the best experience, we suggest to the doors from 1-1/2\" to 1-3/4\" (3.5cm to 4.5cm). NOTE!!! For perfect closing, the door with this Door crane towel rack, be sure there is enough gap over your door: above 1.5mm. Keeps The Things Organized: If you find yourself reaching for yesterday's towel when you get out of the shower only to discover it is wet and crumpled on the floor, you need a more effective hanging solution. A good over-the-door towel rack can keep your bathroom tidy and help damp items dry faster. it will help you in creating more space. It holds your clothes and accessories without taking extras space in your bedroom.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51aXn7KcYiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ahomiwow","source_asin":"B09BT6Z9TW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-650163","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BT6Z9TW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BT6Z9TW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
