window.products.push({"id":650212,"name":"CoTa Global Surfboard Glitter Snow Globe - Resin Stone Figurine Tabletop Ornament, Handcrafted Snow Globe with Shells Centerpiece, Colorful Beach Them","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vupu+JQcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE SURFBOARD GLITTER SNOW GLOBE COMES WITH UNIQUE DESIGN YOU WILL LOVE – Improve your home interior by adding novelty decorative figures to your furniture. Shake the surfboard snow globe and be mesmerized by the glitter sand and the seashells. CoTa Global's Surfboard Glitter Snow Globe Figure is designed to add beach ambiance in any rooms at home or office. A must-have tabletop snow globe decoration to match with other nautical accents. THE CUTE SNOW GLOBE IS FOR BEACH LOVERS – Anyone who loves to feel closer to the beach and nature would be excited to see the surfboard snow globe decor on the tabletop. This unique snow globe will fit any nautical home décor set up. Ocean or nautical lovers and beachgoers will surely display the snow globe in their homes where they will often see the decorative figure. Makes a great housewarming gift for snow globe & nautical item collectors. INCLUDED WITH THE PURCHASE OF SNOW GLOBE CENTERPIECE - Includes 1 CoTa Global Surfboard Glitter Snow Globe measuring about 3\" inches tall. Features seashells and green powdery glitter sand inside the globe. A hand craved surfboard figure, decorated with flowers is attached on one side of the round base that secures the round snow globe. A decorative snow globe that is certain to thrill your guests and will make a stunning eye-catching display. HIGH-QUALITY SURFER NAUTICAL GLOBE HOME DECOR – The surfboard snow globe is made with premium quality polyresin and durable materials. Hand-painted with brown, white, & green colors and has a vibrant finish. The crystal globe features small seashells mixed in green glittery sand. An artistically crafted ornament that highlights the beauty of cute shells and handcrafted surfboard figure to use as novelty home decoration. IDEAL USE FOR THE SURFBOARD SNOW GLOBE DECOR - Tabletop accent to top any cabinet table, wall, or shelf to bring the beach vibes at home or office & complement any beach-themed room decor. This beautiful & elegant handcrafted surfboard snow globe will stylishly showcase your favorite relaxing beach scenery. Perfect colorful accent to place in any rooms at home. Gift as a souvenir for tourists in beach resorts and coastal areas.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vupu+JQcL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CoTa Global","source_asin":"B076H91JC5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-650212","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B076H91JC5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B076H91JC5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
