window.products.push({"id":650247,"name":"PAWIE Premium Cutting Board for Kitchen - Chopping Board for Meat, Cheese and Vegetables, Reversible (Medium), Yellow (A002)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+EX2xuCKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"As a cooking enthusiast, you must know how difficult it is to find the right cutting board that does not roughen up your knife blade and lasts long. If you are on the hunt for chopping boards we have got you covered. Pawie is presenting one-of-a-kind cutting boards for kitchen in 3 different designs and shapes so you can purchase the one that fits your needs. Easy storage as you can just hang them by wall and beautiful intricate patterns will inspire you to cook delicious food and create magic with your hands. It can you prevent slipping and twisting by putting MDF wood in the middle, but you can also cook pleasant dishes with perfectly cut veggies and sliced meat. Ideal choice for professional chefs and cooks as the chopping board for meat is two-sided with different designs so you can use one side for vegetable/fruits and the other one for slicing meats to minimize the risk of dirty. Can also be used as charcuterie board, flood platter, and cheese board. It can be used in dishwashers, but it is not recommended because deformation may occur at high temperatures. Precautions : 1. When using it for the first time, use a neutral detergent and use a soft sponge. 2. Don't put a hot container on the cutting board because it can deform. 3. Don't put the product near the firearm. 4. Do not use knives other than cooking knives. (Be careful of Chinese and sashimi knives) 5. The image of the product may be slightly different from the actual one. A perfect cutting board to assist you with cooking delicious dishes!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+EX2xuCKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PAWIE","source_asin":"B09KPMYTWJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-650247","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KPMYTWJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KPMYTWJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
