window.products.push({"id":650331,"name":"Saffron Marigold - Vanilla Glace - White and Gold Romantic Elegant Luxury Hand Printed - Sheer Cotton Voile Window Valance Curtain - Rod Pocket - (46 ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rWJmKIUOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Dust your windows with glistening sugar when you top them with our opulent white-on-white Vanilla Glacé valances. Decorative and subtle at the same time, the scrolling ogee print will remind you of frosting piped across a beautiful white cake. Delicate shimmery gold veining and tiny glistening beads complete the dazzling, confectionery look. Whether you use the valances alone, or along with our matching white-on-white Vanilla Glacé curtains, you’re guaranteed to bring a dreamy, romantic vibe to your space.The window valance is 46-inches wide and 17-inches long. Each valance is printed on preshrunk, superior grade, soft cotton voile and is exquisitely finished with a delicate, hand beaded trim at the bottom and a 3-inch rod pocket on the top for easy hanging.Each piece is handcrafted using intricately hand carved wooden blocks and is an original work of art distinguished by the work of the artisan, the particular lot of dye, and even varying weather conditions. Tonal variations are inherent to the block printing process and enhance the individuality, character and uniqueness of each creation. Inspiration for Vanilla Glace: Dreams spun in white and gold... tendrils of warm, golden amber smoke rise sensuously to embrace filigreed snowflake like motifs. Vanilla Glacé has a character that is luminous and ethereal and is yet seductively intoxicating. The print orchestrates a delicate contrast of movements: the playful and sensuous movement of the gold veining, the fluttering innocence of the filigreed snowflake like motifs and the stately gilded solidity of its border. We invite you to take flight on gauzy vanilla scented dreams spun in sugary white and radiant gold.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rWJmKIUOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Saffron Marigold","source_asin":"B008PCK1CW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-650331","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B008PCK1CW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B008PCK1CW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
