window.products.push({"id":650487,"name":"Memory Foam Pillow, Cervical Pillow for Neck Pain Relief, Neck Support Pillows for Sleeping, Ergonomic Orthopedic Contour Pillow, Cooling Gel Bed Pill","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NWdu8PtNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Contoured memory foam pillow For a good night's sleep Perfect for back, side and stomach sleepers. This is a unique and most comfortable contour memory foam pillow with a combination of high-quality, breathable memory foam and a new, innovative, luxurious and cooling breathable outer cover. The bed pillow supports your head and also reduces tension in your body after a full day's work. In addition to providing comfort and support, the memory foam pillow also promotes proper spinal alignment while you sleep. Get the memory foam pillow home now and enjoy a restful sleep in everyday life. What makes it special: 1. Pressure relieving memory foam molds to your unique shape for personalized comfort and support 2. Always retains its firmness and won't go flat over time like fiber bed pillows 3. The contoured design helps align your unique shape more naturally 4. The outer cover is soft and breathable to improve the cooling ability of the pillow 5. Can be used as a leg pillow to relax your legs in comfort. Specifications: 1. Size: 3 sizes to choose: standard/queen/king 2. Filling material: 100% high quality memory foam 3 Interior foam color: blue 4. Washable inner foam: no 5 Outer material: 60% cotton, 40% tencel 6. Removable and washable cover: yes 7. Package includes: 1 x memory foam pillow with covers Notes: 1. Remove the compressed pad and lay it on a flat surface in a warm, well-ventilated room and allow 24-48 hours for expansion 2. The pillow is vacuum packed and sealed, which may cause a slight new smell when unpacked for the first time. The smell is harmless and should disappear quickly, 3. Don't put the whole pillow directly into the washing machine. (Only the outer cover is machine washable) 4. Give yourself some time to get used to this new pillow.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NWdu8PtNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SROROG","source_asin":"B09M5QG6KV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-650487","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09M5QG6KV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09M5QG6KV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
