window.products.push({"id":650634,"name":"Cord Wrapper for Small Kitchen Appliances: 16 Pack Upgraded Cord Organizer Cord Holder with Reusable Cable Ties, Power Cord Keeper Stick on Coffee Mak","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Umfm8PmUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Perfect for Keeping Your Cords Neat And Organized]: Are you tired of cords run amuck and get all tangled? These self-adhesive cord keeper are the perfect storage solution for keeping cords where they should be instead of counter tops. Lanfrom power cord organizer is an up-graded version in terms of stickiness and storage space. Extremely strict QC standards with high-quality internal components ensure strong hold and keep the cords neat and out of way. [Upgraded 1 - Thicker Material & Powerful Stickiness]: Our cord wrappers adopts 5mm thick thermoplastic elastomer material, which is more durable and stronger than other 2.5mm thick material. In addition, the sticking part is made of reinforced version of non-marking double-sided strong adhesive. And the sticking area has been increased to 2-3 times as compared with similar products, make it stick really well but also leaves no marks that are difficult to clean. [Upgraded 2 - Organize Thicker & Longer Cord]: Lanfrom Cord holder for kitchen appliances is 2.7cm wide(Others is 1.7cm wide), which can easily wrap thicker and more cords. And the edge-tightening design structure makes the cord inside the wire organizer for appliances more stable and not easy to spread. Larger Capacity, sticks securely and accommodates almost all the electrical cords you have encountered, Much neater and easier storage. [Fit for Any Surface And Cords]: Package includes 16 cable winder and 4 cable ties. Our wire collector has good ductility, so they bend and you can shape them to whatever surface you need, include curved surfaces. Work perfectly with your various home electronics appliances such as offee makers, blenders, juicers, air fryers, toasters, pressure cookers, stand mixers, rice cookers, food processor, fan, ice maker, etc. All your kitchen equipment wires will be in order. [Easily Organize Cords & Keep Your Kitchen Tidy]: This cord management gadgets can be easily used with one hand. 1. Clean the surface. 2. Tear off the tearing paper and press it on surface. 3. Wait 24H. Super convenient. And as LANFROM's dedication to quality to perfection, all LANFROM cord organiser for cables is backed by a lifetime warranty(100% refund or new replacement). Any problem, please feel free to contact us via Amazon, we will solve them for you very quickly.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Umfm8PmUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LANFROM","source_asin":"B0BPXVNXFG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-650634","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPXVNXFG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPXVNXFG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
