window.products.push({"id":650675,"name":"KOIOS USB Rechargeable Food Scale, 33lb/15Kg Kitchen Scale Digital Weight Grams and oz for Cooking Baking, 1g/0.1oz Precise Graduation, Waterproof Tem","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51F8G8vocPL._AC_.jpg","description":"【RECHARGEABLE & ENERGY-SAVING】KOIOS food scale uses rechargeables which are extremely efficient in lowering carbon impact. Once fully charged, the energy-saving digital scale has a long battery life of 2-3 months – charge scales with a USB cable (about 2 hours), so no batteries are needed! 【HIGH WEIGHT CAPACITY & ACCURACY】The upgraded full plate sensing and exclusive 33lb large weight capacity kitchen scale combine with the four built-in high-precision load sensors sensing for stable and accurate results in different places on the scale's surface. Whether it's a small amount of seasoning or a huge piece of meat, accurate responses with 1g/0.1oz increment meet your diverse needs. Range of measurement: 0.1oz to 33 lbs (2g to 15 kg). 【CONVENIENT & MULTIFUNCTIONAL】With the unit button, you may instantly switch between 6 different measurement units: g, kg, oz, lb:oz, ml, ml (milk). With a single push of the tare calculation button, you can subtract the weight of the plate or container. Couldn't be easier, isn't it? 【AUTOMATIC & SMART】In order to make your measurements easy and precise, KOIOS designed a digital food scale with an automated overload and low battery warning. To save energy the auto shut-off function turns off the food scale backlight after 10s and shuts off the digital kitchen scales after 2 mins of inactivity. 【PRACTICAL & USER-FRIENDLY DESIGN】The premium tempered glass panel provides exceptional durability, wear-resistant, and sleek surface for easy cleanup. While also being waterproof and feels secured under the tap. KOIOS portable digital kitchen scale is compact, lightweight and thin making it easy to handle. When storing, an attached hook saves space in the kitchen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51F8G8vocPL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KOIOS","source_asin":"B0BL2FPMJF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-650675","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BL2FPMJF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BL2FPMJF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
