window.products.push({"id":650892,"name":"Eneocare Natural Carved Coconut Bowls with Spoons and Forks | Eco-friendly Vegan Organic Non-toxic Reusable Smoothie Buddha Acai Bowl for Kitchen, Din","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81O3ao8BUlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【100% NATURAL - ECO-FRIENDLY - ORGANIC】: Our coconut bowl set have many advantages to use because they are made from 100% natural, free from chemicals and food safe. The organic coconut vegan bowls contain zero synthetic material and 100% free of parabens or plastics. Each smoothie bowl is a great sustainable product to reuse over and over again. 【DURABLE - LIGHTWEIGHT - EASY TO CLEAN & STORE】: The sturdy of natural coconut shell bowls makes the coconut dinnerware strong and long-lasting, offering you a lifetime of reuse. Hand wash only with lukewarm soapy water and drip-dry immediately after using. Even should not use in microwave, dishwasher, or oven. 【VERSATILE - MULTIPLE APPLICATIONS】: These carved coconut smoothie bowls with smoothie spoons and forks are ideal and perfect for your daily meals as same as for wooden smoothie bowls, buddha bowls, wooden fruit bowls, cereal candle bowls, snack bowls, acai bowls, vegan bowls, … The organic wooden bowls turn your delicious meals into masterpieces. Even using them as home décor, accessories, art storage pieces. They are large enough to serve for dinner parties, picnics, events and brunch. 【UNIQUE DESIGN - HANDCRAFTED WITH LOVE】: Our hand turned wooden bowls are handmade by skilled Vietnamese artisans using special and traditional methods to create unique item with their love and passion. No two coconut bowls are the same markings, size and shape in nature, which is why all our acai bowls are different. Embrace their imperfections as that's what makes coconut bowls so special. 【PERFECT GIFT FOR NATURE LOVERS】: There is nothing better than giving your family or friends an extra special and memorable gift if they are interested in nature. The elegant and practical coconut bowls can inspire you to live more mindfully and healthier. Transform your ordinary smoothie bowls into photogenic masterpieces while also creating a beautiful Planet Earth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81O3ao8BUlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ENEOCARE","source_asin":"B09B4B4YPK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-650892","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09B4B4YPK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09B4B4YPK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
