window.products.push({"id":650927,"name":"Sobro Coffee Table with Refrigerator Drawer Bluetooth Speakers, LED Lights, & USB Charging Ports for Tablets, Laptops, or a Cell Phone-Perfect for Par","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712Jnlg3aYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Designed with a refrigerator drawer, the Sobro keeps beverages and food chilled and always within reach. Featuring Bluetooth speakers, charging ports, LED lights, and a sleek touch panel for optimal control, the Dobro coffee table always keeps you connected. From the Manufacturer $1,559,110 raised with 2,051 backers. Set The Mood Start the party with rich sound quality. Speakers on each side of the Sobro coffee table deliver enhanced sound and bass. LED lights on the underside of the Sobro set the mood for a Netflix night or your next big bash. Control it all right from the tabletop. No app download required. Power Up USB Charging ports and outlets on the side allow you to conveniently charge all your devices, from phones, to tablets, to your miniature indoor drone. When you’re done, roll up your cords and stash them neatly out of sight in the storage drawers. Keep It Chill A built-in refrigerator keeps drinks cool for days and stores your beverages for any occasion. Turn up the sound and lights Play your favorite tunes and light up the LED lights to make your living room party central. Touch controls With a tempered glass top and touch controls, the power to control Sobro is right at your fingertips -- no app required. And with a durable tempered glass top, you’ll never need a coaster again. Streamlined & Simple We created the Sobro coffee table to stand on its own as a sleek and beautiful design. The Sobro is designed to complement your lifestyle and your living room. About the Startup Describe your product in 3 words. Smart. Connected. Chill. How did you come up with the idea for this product? We wanted to create the coffee table for a modern world. The Sobro is designed to be furniture that works with your smart lifestyle. In our always-on world, we wanted to make it convenient to charge all of your digital devices and get a cold beverage without ever leaving the couch but we didn’t stop there. What makes your product special? Never before has a simple coffee table been so advanced. The Sobro not only accommodates your individual world, but acts as a command center to bring people together. What has been the best part of your startup experience? We grow and learn with our products. The Sobro is just one example of how we seek to expand and are inspired by what we create at StoreBound. Just like the Sobro, we stay connected.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/712Jnlg3aYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"sobro","source_asin":"B0793CLWW7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-650927","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0793CLWW7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0793CLWW7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
