window.products.push({"id":650961,"name":"Gifts for Mom,Neoprene Mini Oven Mitts,2pk- Heat Resistant Kitchen Gloves to Protect Hands, Non-Slip Grip- Ideal Set for Handling Hot Cookware","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6108pkOB9QL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Careme Oven Mitts,natural cotton material, soft and comfortable, safe and healthy,It's good to protect your arm from burns.Hope it can let you enjoy the fun of the kitchen.Let's Say Goodbye to Accidental Burns!Taste the delicious taste of each mouth and enjoy the happiness of life!Made of durable, heat-resistant cotton and neoprene, these oven mitts will help shield your hands from heat up-to 400℉.super soft cotton and premium insulation to guard your hands and fingers from heat, steam and grease - no more worries or risk of burning your skin.Textured, neoprene grips ensure a more secure hold when handling hot cookware,effectively prevent items from slipping off.Heat resistant mini gloves are outstanding in gripping hot pans and hot dishes quickly and easily.Ergonomic oven mit offers perfect protection for your palm.every mitt fits both left and right hand, so you can quickly wear it when cooking in the kitchen.Heat resistant mini gloves are outstanding in gripping hot pans and hot dishes quickly and easily. It's perfect for oven, pot, trivet, grill, casserole, hot cookware, unscrewing a hot light bulb, BBQ, camping and so on.The design of these careme oven mitts will suit most kitchen decorations,ideal gift for Mother's Day, Christmas, Thanksgiving and housewarming.Oven Mitts Feature:Material:Neoprene, CottonSize:7*5.5inchColor:black,navyPackage Includes:1 pair oven mitts SATISFACTION IS OUR PRIORITY - We want to have each customer feel like they are part of the careme family. If you aren't satisfied for any reason with your oven mitts , please reach out to us directly so we can take care of you.Attention:1. Do Not directly touch fire.2. Please wash them by hands.3. Do Not use bleach and fabric softener.4. Please unfold the mitts for air drying.5. Do Not use cook mittens if they are wet.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/6108pkOB9QL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"careme","source_asin":"B08KJ6NBYF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-650961","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KJ6NBYF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KJ6NBYF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
